{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af26","chatId":"85f7e3d8ea1f48d090cc1480ba8eff81","sessionId":null,"userId":69594,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1207,"promptTokens":1468,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:03"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002800282944976142,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af25","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369783629,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af25","chatId":"85f7e3d8ea1f48d090cc1480ba8eff81","sessionId":null,"userId":69594,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n菲是一名在美国学习的伊朗学生，她邀请了她的同学金尼斯来家里吃午饭。按照伊朗的传统，菲立刻给金尼斯提供了屋内穿的拖鞋，但金尼斯礼貌地拒绝了，说她更喜欢穿自己的鞋子。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，菲最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬\nB) 开心\nC) 自豪\nD) 反对\nE) 包容\nF) 感激\n\n## 问题 2\n菲为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 金尼斯没有尊重她的文化，尽管菲提出要换鞋\nB) 菲不喜欢金尼斯的鞋子\nC) 菲觉得金尼斯来吃午餐很无礼\nD) 金尼斯没有对午餐的邀请表示感谢","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002800282944976142,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af26","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369783627,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"359d9fc208e54fdc9872067ee311c3b5"}